        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About This Game: &quot;Blue Hawaii Aniki's Soft Ore Demand Vol. 1&quot; is a comedy visual novel parodying late-night variety shows. Hosted by the eccentric &quot;Blue Hawaii Aniki&quot;, he guides you into a world filled with unique characters and absurd situations. This is the first volume in the series, and you'll enjoy a story steeped in satire and humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contents (Vol. 1)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A standalone visual novel experience (no prior knowledge required)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four full-length comedy segments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detours enhance the variety show feel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated Playtime: Approximately 2-3 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in Japanese and English</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls for easy play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recommendations: This is perfect for those seeking quirky humor, parody, and everyday comedy with a touch of surrealism. Each volume of the &quot;Soft Ore Demand&quot; series features a different plot and theme, delivering a fresh, late-night variety show experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Image generation for this game was performed using klingAI. It consists of about 200 single images, about 100 audio materials, and a scenario of about 20,000 characters. It focuses on background sounds and sound effects rather than background music, and its immersive feel sets it apart from other works.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About This Game: &quot;Blue Hawaii Aniki's Soft Ore Demand Vol. 1&quot; is a comedy visual novel parodying late-night variety shows. Hosted by the eccentric &quot;Blue Hawaii Aniki&quot;, he guides you into a world filled with unique characters and absurd situations. This is the first volume in the series, and you'll enjoy a story steeped in satire and humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contents (Vol. 1)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A standalone visual novel experience (no prior knowledge required)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four full-length comedy segments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detours enhance the variety show feel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated Playtime: Approximately 2-3 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in Japanese and English</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls for easy play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recommendations: This is perfect for those seeking quirky humor, parody, and everyday comedy with a touch of surrealism. Each volume of the &quot;Soft Ore Demand&quot; series features a different plot and theme, delivering a fresh, late-night variety show experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Image generation for this game was performed using klingAI. It consists of about 200 single images, about 100 audio materials, and a scenario of about 20,000 characters. It focuses on background sounds and sound effects rather than background music, and its immersive feel sets it apart from other works.</p>",
